---
import ResearchIcon from './ResearchIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="playbook-test-comparison" id="testing-gap" aria-labelledby="test-example-title" data-phase="check" data-playing="false">
  <figcaption class="example-heading">
    <div><span class="example-kicker">WHY THE TEST ENVIRONMENT MATTERS</span><h2 id="test-example-title">A successful call.<br /><em>The wrong IP blocked.</em></h2></div>
    <span class="example-label">Illustrative example</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="example-goal">
    <span class="row-label">THE REQUIREMENT</span>
    <div><span class="ip-symbol">A</span><p><strong>Malicious IP</strong><span>Must be blocked</span></p></div>
    <div><span class="ip-symbol">B</span><p><strong>Allowlisted IP</strong><span>Must stay allowed</span></p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="example-command"><ResearchIcon kind="workflow" /><div><span class="row-label">SAME BUGGY PLAYBOOK IN BOTH TESTS</span><p>The workflow calls <code>block_ip(B)</code><span class="bug-label">Wrong target</span></p><span class="call-result">Both calls report success.</span></div></div>

  <div class="test-lanes">
    <section class="test-lane fixed-lane" aria-labelledby="fixed-test-title">
      <div class="lane-heading"><ResearchIcon kind="documents" /><div><span class="row-label">FIXED ACTION RESPONSES</span><h3 id="fixed-test-title">The reply is prewritten.</h3></div></div>
      <p class="lane-description">Replies ignore which IP the workflow blocks.</p>
      <div class="result-block"><span class="row-label">PREWRITTEN QUERY RESULT</span><div class="state-row"><span class="ip-symbol">A</span><span class="ip-description">Malicious IP</span><strong>Blocked</strong></div><div class="state-row"><span class="ip-symbol">B</span><span class="ip-description">Allowlisted IP</span><strong>Allowed</strong></div><span class="result-origin">The expected answer is supplied.</span></div>
      <div class="test-verdict fixed-verdict"><span class="verdict-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>Test passes. Bug missed.</strong><p>The supplied result matches the requirement.</p></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="test-lane state-lane" aria-labelledby="state-test-title">
      <div class="lane-heading"><ResearchIcon kind="environment" /><div><span class="row-label">GENERATED ENVIRONMENT + CHECKS</span><h3 id="state-test-title">The action changes the data.</h3></div></div>
      <p class="lane-description">The call updates the IP it actually targets.</p>
      <div class="result-block"><span class="row-label">OBSERVED ENVIRONMENT STATE</span><div class="state-row"><span class="ip-symbol">A</span><span class="ip-description">Malicious IP</span><strong>Allowed</strong></div><div class="state-row"><span class="ip-symbol">B</span><span class="ip-description">Allowlisted IP</span><strong data-b-state>Blocked</strong></div><span class="result-origin" data-state-origin>Both started allowed. The action changed B.</span></div>
      <div class="test-verdict state-verdict"><span class="verdict-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span><div><strong>Check fails. Bug exposed.</strong><p>A is still allowed. B was wrongly blocked.</p></div></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="example-controls" hidden>
    <div class="example-steps" role="group" aria-label="Example steps"><button type="button" data-example-step="goal" aria-pressed="false">1. Set the goal</button><button type="button" data-example-step="run" aria-pressed="false">2. Run the workflow</button><button type="button" data-example-step="check" aria-pressed="true">3. Check the effect</button></div>
    <div class="example-playback"><p data-example-caption aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Compare the observed state with the requirement: A must be blocked, and B must stay allowed.</p><button type="button" data-play-example>▶ Play example</button></div>
  </div>
  <p class="example-takeaway"><strong>The environment records what happened.</strong> Separate checks decide whether it meets the requirement.</p>
  <p class="example-scope">Existing end-to-end tests can also catch this bug with suitable environments and checks. Our research automates building the service environment.</p>
</figure>

<script>
  const example = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.playbook-test-comparison');
  if (example) {
    const play = example.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-play-example]')!;
    const caption = example.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-example-caption]')!;
    const state = example.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-b-state]')!;
    const origin = example.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-state-origin]')!;
    const reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
    const phases = [
      { id: 'goal', text: 'Start with both IPs allowed. The task is to block malicious IP A and leave allowlisted IP B alone.' },
      { id: 'run', text: 'The same buggy workflow blocks B. A fixed reply stays the same; the generated environment updates B’s state.' },
      { id: 'check', text: 'Check the requirement against the results. The fixed replies hide the bug. The observed state exposes the wrong target.' },
    ];
    let phase = 2, playing = false, started = false, finished = true;
    let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;
    const render = () => {
      example.dataset.phase = phases[phase].id;
      example.dataset.playing = String(playing);
      state.textContent = phase === 0 ? 'Allowed' : 'Blocked';
      origin.textContent = phase === 0 ? 'Starting state: both IPs are allowed.' : 'Both started allowed. The action changed B.';
      example.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-example-step]').forEach(button => button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.exampleStep === phases[phase].id)));
      caption.textContent = phases[phase].text;
      caption.setAttribute('aria-live', playing ? 'off' : 'polite');
      play.textContent = playing ? 'Ⅱ Pause example' : !started ? '▶ Play example' : finished ? '↻ Replay example' : '▶ Continue example';
    };
    const pause = () => { clearTimeout(timer); playing = false; render(); };
    const advance = () => {
      timer = setTimeout(() => {
        if (phase === 2) { finished = true; pause(); return; }
        phase++; render(); advance();
      }, 4000);
    };
    play.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (playing) { pause(); return; }
      if (reduced.matches) return;
      if (finished) phase = 0;
      finished = false; started = true; playing = true; render(); advance();
    });
    example.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-example-step]').forEach(button => button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      clearTimeout(timer); playing = false; started = true;
      phase = phases.findIndex(item => item.id === button.dataset.exampleStep);
      finished = phase === 2; render();
    }));
    const syncMotion = () => { pause(); if (reduced.matches) { phase = 2; finished = true; render(); } play.hidden = reduced.matches; };
    reduced.addEventListener('change', syncMotion);
    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => { if (document.hidden) pause(); });
    new IntersectionObserver(entries => { if (!entries[0].isIntersecting && playing) pause(); }).observe(example);
    example.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.example-controls')!.hidden = false;
    syncMotion();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .playbook-test-comparison{--warning:#ffc6aa;--bad:#ffb3bd;--cool:#b7c5fa;margin:0;padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 0,#98f4db0a,transparent 60%),var(--surface-soft);scroll-margin-top:100px}
  :global([data-theme=light]) .playbook-test-comparison{--warning:#864523;--bad:#a33143;--cool:#505f9e}
  .example-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px}.example-kicker,.row-label{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.09em;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.example-kicker{margin-bottom:13px}
  h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',sans-serif;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.15;font-weight:550}h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.example-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);padding:5px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap}
  .example-goal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:28px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--bg);transition:border-color .3s}.example-goal>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.ip-symbol{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;color:var(--text)}.example-goal p{margin:0;line-height:1.5}.example-goal strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.example-goal p span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .example-command{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin:17px 0;padding:17px 20px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 35%,var(--line));border-radius:12px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 4%,var(--bg));transition:box-shadow .3s}.example-command :global(.research-icon){width:35px;height:35px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--warning)}.example-command p{font-size:14px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.8}.example-command code{font-size:14px;color:var(--warning);font-weight:600}.bug-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--warning);padding-left:15px}
  .test-lanes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.test-lane{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--bg);min-width:0}.state-lane{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 35%,var(--line))}.lane-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.lane-heading :global(.research-icon){width:32px;height:32px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--cool)}.state-lane .lane-heading :global(.research-icon){color:var(--accent)}h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable',sans-serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-top:5px}.lane-description{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin:15px 0;min-height:44px}
  .result-block{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px;min-height:130px}.result-block>.row-label{margin-bottom:12px;font-size:8px}.result-origin{font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:12px}.state-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12px;margin:8px 0}.state-row .ip-symbol{width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px;border-radius:6px}.state-row strong{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.state-lane .state-row:last-of-type strong{color:var(--warning)}.call-result{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
  .test-verdict{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:15px 12px;margin-top:16px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:78px;transition:opacity .3s}.fixed-verdict{color:var(--accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,var(--bg))}.state-verdict{color:var(--bad);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bad) 5%,var(--bg))}.verdict-icon{font-size:24px}.test-verdict strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.test-verdict p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:4px}
  .example-controls{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.example-controls[hidden]{display:none}.example-steps{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}.example-steps button{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:7px 11px;cursor:pointer}.example-steps button[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}.example-playback{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:15px}.example-playback p{max-width:700px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--text);min-height:45px}.example-playback>button{flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;color:var(--accent);background:transparent;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}
  .example-takeaway{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin-top:22px}.example-takeaway strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:550}.example-scope{font-size:10px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;max-width:900px}
  [data-phase=goal] .example-goal{border-color:var(--accent)}[data-phase=goal] .test-verdict,[data-phase=run] .test-verdict{visibility:hidden}[data-phase=run] .example-command{box-shadow:0 0 24px color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 12%,transparent)}[data-playing=true][data-phase=run] .state-row:last-of-type{animation:state-flash 1.5s ease-in-out 2}@keyframes state-flash{50%{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 12%,transparent)}}
  @media(max-width:760px){.playbook-test-comparison{padding:24px}.test-lanes{gap:14px}.test-lane{padding:16px}.lane-heading{align-items:flex-start;gap:9px}.lane-heading :global(.research-icon){width:27px;height:27px}.lane-heading .row-label{font-size:8px}h3{font-size:17px}.lane-description{min-height:65px}.result-block{min-height:177px}.example-goal{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.example-goal>.row-label{grid-column:1/-1}.test-verdict{min-height:98px}}
  @media(max-width:540px){.playbook-test-comparison{padding:21px 16px;border-radius:17px}.example-heading{display:block}h2{font-size:29px}.example-kicker{font-size:8px}.example-label{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:9px}.example-goal{margin-top:20px;padding:14px;gap:12px 8px}.example-goal>div{gap:8px}.example-goal strong{font-size:11px}.example-goal p span{font-size:10px}.ip-symbol{width:26px;height:26px}.example-command{padding:14px 12px;gap:10px}.example-command .row-label{font-size:7px}.example-command p,.example-command code{font-size:12px}.bug-label{display:block;padding:0;font-size:9px}.example-command :global(.research-icon){width:28px;height:28px}.test-lanes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.test-lane{padding:18px}.lane-heading .row-label{font-size:8px}h3{font-size:19px}.lane-description{min-height:0;font-size:12px;margin:12px 0}.result-block{min-height:0;padding-top:13px}.test-verdict{min-height:0;margin-top:15px;padding:12px}.example-playback{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.example-playback p{min-height:70px;font-size:12px}.example-steps{gap:6px;justify-content:space-between}.example-steps button{font-size:9px;padding:7px 8px}.example-takeaway{font-size:11px}.example-scope{font-size:10px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
  @media(min-width:541px){.playbook-test-comparison{padding:27px}.example-goal{margin-top:22px;padding:15px 18px}.example-command{padding:13px 18px;margin:14px 0}.test-lane{padding:18px}.lane-description{min-height:0;margin:12px 0}.test-verdict{min-height:65px;padding:12px;margin-top:12px}.example-controls{padding-top:14px;margin-top:17px}.example-takeaway{margin-top:16px}.example-playback{margin-top:12px}.example-playback p{min-height:0}.example-heading h2{font-size:30px}}
  @media(max-width:540px){.test-lanes{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.test-lane{padding:14px 11px}.lane-heading{display:block}.lane-heading :global(.research-icon){width:26px;height:26px;margin-bottom:8px}.lane-heading .row-label{min-height:28px;font-size:7px}h3{font-size:17px;min-height:64px}.lane-description{font-size:11px;min-height:60px;line-height:1.7}.result-block{min-height:167px}.result-block>.row-label{font-size:7px;min-height:24px}.ip-description{display:none}.state-row{gap:4px}.state-row strong{font-size:11px}.state-row .ip-symbol{width:23px;height:23px}.result-origin{font-size:9px;line-height:1.6}.test-verdict{display:block;padding:10px 8px;min-height:140px}.verdict-icon{display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:5px}.test-verdict strong{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;display:block}.test-verdict p{font-size:9px}.example-goal{margin-top:18px}.example-playback p{min-height:65px}}
  @media print{.playbook-test-comparison{break-inside:avoid;background:none;padding:18px}.example-controls{display:none}.test-verdict{visibility:visible!important}}
</style>
